### Register Customer
POST https://localhost:7124/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullname": "Nguyen Van Customer",
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "phone": "0900000001",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "customer"
}

###

### Register Nurse
POST https://localhost:7124/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullname": "Nguyen Thi Nurse",
  "email": "nurse@example.com",
  "phone": "0900000002",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "nurse"
}

###

### Login
POST https://localhost:7124/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lan.customer@momcare.local",
  "password": "MomCare@123"
}

###

### Get Current User (Protected - requires token)
GET https://localhost:7124/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

###

### [NEW] Register Customer Endpoint
POST https://localhost:7124/api/auth/signup/customer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullname": "New Customer Flow",
  "email": "cust_new@example.com",
  "phone": "0900000003",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### [NEW] Register Nurse Endpoint
POST https://localhost:7124/api/auth/signup/nurse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullname": "New Nurse Flow",
  "email": "nurse_new@example.com",
  "phone": "0900000004",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "bio": "Expert Pediatric Nurse",
  "yearsExperience": 7,
  "serviceRadiusKm": 15
}

###

### [NEW] External Login (Google)
# Requires a valid Google ID Token obtained from frontend (Client)
POST https://localhost:7124/api/auth/login/external
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "google",
  "idToken": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6ImZmZmZmZmZmZmZmZmZmZmZmZmZmZmZmZmZmZmZmZmYiLCJ0eXAiOiJKV1QifQ..."
}

###

### [NEW] External Login (Facebook)
# Requires a valid Facebook Access Token obtained from frontend (Client)
POST https://localhost:7124/api/auth/login/external
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "facebook",
  "idToken": "EAAL........"
}

###

### [NEW] Confirm Nurse (Admin Only)
# Note: Replace {id} with actual Nurse User ID. Requires Admin Token.
POST https://localhost:7124/api/admin/nurses/2/confirm
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

###

### [NEW] Unconfirm Nurse (Admin Only)
POST https://localhost:7124/api/admin/nurses/2/unconfirm
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
